      "value": "How about have the world author set the maximum player size and the instance creator can set anything in between? That way game worlds or experiences, as an example could max out at 4 slots for a team size, the theme of the world remains unaffected and can't get cheesed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
