      "value": "@{5e8c2e14af4a860606a60ca3|full_name}: I don't think that would be useful as most of the time its that there is not enough space not that there needs to be more restrictions. Plus as mentioned game worlds marked (as they should be) as game worlds will have unchangeable player-counts.\n\nI don't see anything wrong with allow others to change the instance number for an instance they've created and if its set to high and reaches those numbers then its pretty common knowledge that there will be a perf hit.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
