      "value": "@{5a49664b513e7625f7f9509e|full_name}: I disagree- I know a lot of people in my community that would benefit from being able to create public game world instances with lower capacities so that they don't get overcrowded and start lagging. It's especially bad right now since there's a bug making public worlds accessible beyond the recommended limit.\n\nI think that in general, the max player count is part of the world's design. It would be great to be able to lower it when creating instances, but you should never be able to go over it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
